<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Unipetrol plans share swap ratios.</title>
<headline>Czech Unipetrol plans share swap ratios.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The boards of shareholders comprising the main Czech refining company Unipetrol a.s. on Wednesday announced their plan for the conversion of Kaucuk a.s. and Chemopetrol a.s. shares into Unipetrol shares.</p>
<p>In a joint statement of the boards of Chemopetrol, Kaucuk and Unipetrol, the boards said they agreed to swap one Chemopetrol share for between 1.05 to 1.20 Unipetrol shares, and one Kaucuk share for between 1.10 to 1.25 Unipetrol shares.</p>
</text>
